Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Silakan naik.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.20,0:00:13.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat, aku datang dua jam\Nlebih cepat dari waktu janjian.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.26,0:00:17.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau ngapain aku selama dua jam ke depan?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.13,0:00:23.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.31,0:00:28.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.12,0:00:37.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuduga.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.02,0:00:47.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau datang cepat sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.30,0:02:25.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.07,0:02:28.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak mau membuatmu menunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.01,0:02:30.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebenarnya, aku juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.16,0:02:33.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.69,0:02:34.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.75,0:02:35.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.57,0:02:39.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kucing?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.58,0:02:42.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, ada banyak kucing di sekitar sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lu-Lucu sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kucing...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.68,0:02:50.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.00,0:02:52.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.79,0:02:55.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tunggu...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato si Dingin malah diperlakukan dingin...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.65,0:03:05.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kalau kau coba memotretnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.62,0:03:07.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau genius, Oshio!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.69,0:03:10.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tetap di situ. Jangan ke mana-mana...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.02,0:03:11.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.35,0:03:14.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.60,0:03:15.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.15,0:03:21.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wajar saja.\NMemotret hewan memang sulit.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.12,0:03:25.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi kau lebih jago daripada aku, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.15,0:03:27.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudku, iya, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.34,0:03:28.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.59,0:03:32.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Aku akan mengajarimu cara memotret kucing!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benarkah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.12,0:03:35.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan mengajarimu sebisaku,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.42,0:03:38.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,walau aku sendiri tidak begitu jago.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.37,0:03:39.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi sebentar.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.19,0:03:40.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,O-O-Oshio?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.67,0:03:46.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lebih mudah menunjukkannya\Nkalau aku bisa melihat layarnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.63,0:03:49.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, bukankah kita\Npernah begini sebelumnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Y-Ya, benar...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.33,0:03:52.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah, pertama-tama...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.34,0:03:53.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.02,0:03:53.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.63,0:03:54.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Telinga...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.66,0:03:57.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suaramu tepat di telingaku...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.30,0:03:58.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.14,0:03:59.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Maaf!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.97,0:04:03.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Fokus, fokus, fokus!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.90,0:04:09.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ba-Baiklah, matikan flash-nya,\Ndan sejajarkan kamera dengan mata kucing.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.57,0:04:12.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kucing, sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.10,0:04:15.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami akan terus begini\Nsampai dia selesai memotret...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini gawat buatku...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.15,0:04:20.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato, kau bisa memotret kapan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.49,0:04:21.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.40,0:04:24.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meong.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato! Foto!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.12,0:04:32.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sa-Sato?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.95,0:04:35.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lakukan itu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.39,0:04:36.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.78,0:04:39.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,La-Lakukan sekali lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.34,0:04:42.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke-Kenapa malah kau yang lebih\Nheboh daripada kucingnya?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.14,0:04:44.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya? Ya? Kumohon?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.18,0:04:45.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satu kali lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.06,0:04:47.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu... Mundur! Mundur!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku rekam! Sekali lagi saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.29,0:04:50.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serius, awas!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.22,0:04:55.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.18,0:04:58.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak apa-apa, Sato?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.67,0:05:02.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.21,0:05:06.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian mau apakan kucingku?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.51,0:05:09.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pre-Preman...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.95,0:05:15.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini Leo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.57,0:05:18.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku Murasaki Madoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.12,0:05:19.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ba-Baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.94,0:05:22.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia masuk mode malu-malu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.43,0:05:23.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Y-Ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.70,0:05:26.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nama kalian. Ayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.62,0:05:28.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah menyebutkan namaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.63,0:05:33.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,So-Sota. Oshio Sota, kelas 2 SMA.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.33,0:05:35.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Kita seumuran.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana denganmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.54,0:05:38.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ko-Koharu...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.93,0:05:41.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Aku tidak dengar!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.06,0:05:44.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Koharu! Sato Koharu!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, dia memang agak pemalu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.94,0:05:52.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Jadi, kalian datang\Nuntuk berenang atau apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.80,0:05:55.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami akan menginap\Ndi penginapan milik kerabat.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.47,0:05:57.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namanya Kanami.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.47,0:06:02.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Kalian kenalan Nenek Kana?\NBilang dari tadi, dong!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.39,0:06:04.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh! Aduh! Aduh! Aduh!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.06,0:06:09.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, kita ke sana!\NNenek Kana pasti senang sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.03,0:06:10.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Henti...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.04,0:06:12.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.71,0:06:18.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ja-Ja-Jangan begitu!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.26,0:06:20.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.74,0:06:25.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pacarmu hebat, Sota!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.30,0:06:26.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pacar?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.39,0:06:28.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, jalan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.43,0:06:30.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus kerja jam 10.00.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.47,0:06:31.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pa...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.74,0:06:33.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei! Sato?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.93,0:06:47.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak berubah sama sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.99,0:06:51.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,H-Hei!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.68,0:06:54.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak boleh menendang\Npintu rumah orang...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.93,0:06:59.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pintunya macet, jadi harus begini.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.37,0:07:04.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau apa kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.22,0:07:07.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bawa kerabatmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.31,0:07:11.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nenek Kanami!\NLama tidak bertemu! Nenek sehat?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.76,0:07:13.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah berapa kali kubilang dari dulu,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.66,0:07:20.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku bukan nenekmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.77,0:07:26.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau ingat?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.04,0:07:28.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, Bibi Kanami.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.65,0:07:32.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,E-Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.00,0:07:35.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau Koharu, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.91,0:07:37.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Y-Ya, benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.41,0:07:40.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku Koharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.03,0:07:43.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, apa aku membuatmu takut?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.70,0:07:44.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.62,0:07:48.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, kau seperti boneka!\NWajahmu cantik sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.54,0:07:50.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat datang, Koharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.99,0:07:56.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siput?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.63,0:07:58.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keong macan rebus.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.70,0:08:03.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong aku, Oshio!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.02,0:08:06.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, Nenek Kanami minta bantuanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.76,0:08:10.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak dimakan? Ini enak.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.44,0:08:16.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma pernah makan kerang biasa...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.59,0:08:19.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, kau tidak tahu cara memakannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.85,0:08:22.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, perhatikan baik-baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.80,0:08:25.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.67,0:08:27.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, coba.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.40,0:08:28.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Y-Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.89,0:08:34.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau payah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Susah sekali...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, sudah sejauh mana kalian?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.97,0:08:46.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejauh mana apanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.28,0:08:47.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudku...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.56,0:08:51.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan pacarmu! Jangan suruh aku\Nmenyebutkannya terang-terangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.79,0:08:53.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.84,0:08:59.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,O-Oshio bukan laki-laki seperti itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.72,0:09:02.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah? Kalian pacaran, 'kan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.28,0:09:05.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami memang pacaran, tapi, anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.61,0:09:08.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada yang bisa kuceritakan...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ceritakan!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.85,0:09:13.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, baiklah...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.08,0:09:19.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, dia menyatakan perasaannya padaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.43,0:09:23.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Maaf, pasti membosankan, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.79,0:09:26.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maksudmu,\Ntidak ada yang bisa diceritakan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.36,0:09:29.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian saling menyatakan perasaan,\Nlalu pacaran.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.41,0:09:33.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi kami belum melakukan apa pun\Nlayaknya sepasang kekasih...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.90,0:09:39.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah, aku paham kalau kalian\Ntakut mengubah hubungan yang sudah ada.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.30,0:09:40.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.14,0:09:43.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi suka atau tidak, semuanya akan berubah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.49,0:09:48.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau diam saja, keadaan akan berubah\Nke arah yang bakal kau sesali.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.75,0:09:50.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Murasaki...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.32,0:09:53.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Murasaki, kau juga sedang menyukai seseorang?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.14,0:09:56.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.14,0:09:58.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah! Reaksimu jelas-jelas bilang "iya"!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.94,0:10:02.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cerita cinta itu harus saling berbagi, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.07,0:10:06.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial, harusnya aku tidak membahas itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.36,0:10:12.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini sudah lama,\Nwaktu aku masih tinggal di Sakuraba.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.70,0:10:15.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, dulu kau tinggal di Sakuraba?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.33,0:10:17.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai aku masuk SMP.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.78,0:10:21.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi aku tidak pernah bertemu lagi dengannya\Nsejak pindah ke sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.83,0:10:26.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami sudah kenal lama,\Ndan akur, jadi sering main bersama.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.03,0:10:28.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dipikir-pikir...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.65,0:10:32.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu cinta pertamamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.38,0:10:33.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.10,0:10:34.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.57,0:10:35.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau masih menyukainya!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.98,0:10:37.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak mungkin!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.42,0:10:38.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, masa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.16,0:10:42.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah, cukup.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.22,0:10:46.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, preman memang\Nbertindak duluan sebelum bicara!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.22,0:10:48.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa yang kau sebut preman?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.06,0:10:49.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau memang preman...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.05,0:10:52.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah? Tidak bisa dibuka.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.07,0:10:56.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin kita harus menelepon mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.69,0:10:58.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku yang menelepon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.55,0:10:59.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.70,0:11:02.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemiliknya sedang keluar!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.11,0:11:03.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.31,0:11:06.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka sedang tutup...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.42,0:11:10.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.69,0:11:17.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.65,0:11:21.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.03,0:11:24.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.39,0:11:31.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.64,0:11:34.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei! Kau mau ke mana, Koharu?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.18,0:11:35.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Koharu!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.62,0:11:36.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.78,0:11:37.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.75,0:11:53.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Murasaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.36,0:11:56.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Anu, apa Ren melakukan sesuatu?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.83,0:11:59.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuduga. Itu memang Ren.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.58,0:12:01.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sedang apa dia di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.59,0:12:05.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tunggu, jangan-jangan anak laki-laki\Nyang dulu kau sukai itu
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.92,0:12:07.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah Ren...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dulu aku cuma tertarik padanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.70,0:12:12.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktu itu aku masih SD!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.02,0:12:14.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau paham maksudnya, 'kan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.93,0:12:21.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Boleh aku panggil kau Madoka?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.47,0:12:22.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.50,0:12:23.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita sudah saling curhat soal cinta,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.70,0:12:26.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,jadi kupikir kita bisa saling memanggil\Nnama depan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.28,0:12:29.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Caramu mengakrabkan diri aneh sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.53,0:12:30.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.38,0:12:34.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,itu sudah lama berakhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.55,0:12:36.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum berakhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.69,0:12:40.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu belum berakhir!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.15,0:12:43.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena kau masih menyukai Ren, Madoka!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.69,0:12:45.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau kabur karena kau menyukainya!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.35,0:12:48.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal kesempatanmu sudah di depan mata!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.95,0:12:51.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sendiri yang bilang, kalau kau diam saja,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.01,0:12:54.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,keadaan akan berubah\Nke arah yang bakal kau sesali.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.21,0:12:55.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak akan terjadi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.86,0:12:59.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, dia tidak mengingatku.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.39,0:13:02.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, Ren sekarang keren sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.96,0:13:06.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa bisa begitu?!\NMemangnya dia aktor?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.22,0:13:11.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan khawatir! Kau manis!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.23,0:13:13.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.66,0:13:17.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rambutku rusak karena air laut,\Ndan aku tidak bisa berdandan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.79,0:13:21.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau boleh pakai kondisionerku!\NAlat riasku juga!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau sampai sebegitunya?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.71,0:13:24.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Habisnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.25,0:13:33.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita sudah saling berbagi cerita cinta,\Njadi sekarang kita teman!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.32,0:13:38.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.87,0:13:41.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pikirkan dirimu sendiri saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.51,0:13:42.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.12,0:13:45.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau mau memanggil orang\Ndengan nama depannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.97,0:13:46.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,panggil saja pacarmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.14,0:13:49.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pa-Pacar...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.72,0:13:50.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.14,0:13:52.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, Madoka!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.72,0:13:53.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kerja dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.69,0:13:59.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sato!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.82,0:14:01.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.14,0:14:02.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.87,0:14:05.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio, aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.52,0:14:08.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya aku dapat\Nteman perempuan pertamaku!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.15,0:14:11.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh... Bagus, dong.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.40,0:14:12.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.07,0:14:14.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bu Kanami!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.77,0:14:16.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tambah bir!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.30,0:14:18.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebentar. 750 yen per botol.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.91,0:14:22.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?! Penipuan!\NPerampokan terang-terangan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shizuku.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.30,0:14:25.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu namanya harga turis, Nak.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.78,0:14:28.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bawakan limun untukmu, Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.34,0:14:33.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau harus makan lebih banyak.\NKau kurus sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.40,0:14:35.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak lapar.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.67,0:14:38.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, selamat datang kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.70,0:14:41.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sota! Sini!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.12,0:14:44.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuangkan minuman untukku!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.75,0:14:46.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shizuku, itu namanya pelecehan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.72,0:14:47.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.13,0:14:49.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keong macan kesukaanku...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.85,0:14:52.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku menantikannya...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.02,0:14:54.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf! Sudah kuhabiskan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.51,0:14:57.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sebegitu inginnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.48,0:14:58.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.49,0:15:03.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.07,0:15:09.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bu-Buka mulutmu, Kak Oshio.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.34,0:15:12.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, a-aku hargai niatmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.90,0:15:16.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi tidak usah.\NKau saja yang makan, Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.08,0:15:18.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ta-Tapi kau suka, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.58,0:15:20.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.10,0:15:24.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Justru karena aku suka,\Naku ingin kau yang memakannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.93,0:15:27.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Y-Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.02,0:15:30.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak. Maaf, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.58,0:15:43.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah! Aku sudah kenyang!\NSemangat! Semuanya, kumpul!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.77,0:15:47.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita pergi ke pantai!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.73,0:15:49.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.98,0:15:50.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.23,0:15:58.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Ren, mau berenang?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.91,0:16:01.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, terima kasih.\NKalau mau, pergi saja sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.55,0:16:04.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak mau pergi sendiri,\Ntunggu saja para gadis.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.38,0:16:05.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,I-Itu masalahnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.34,0:16:09.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato akan datang memakai pakaian renang!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.09,0:16:12.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku tidak melakukan sesuatu\Nuntuk mengalihkan pikiran, aku bisa...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.66,0:16:13.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.37,0:16:14.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.64,0:16:17.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, suasana hatimu sedang buruk\Nhari ini, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.40,0:16:18.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada sesuatu yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.01,0:16:23.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku lupa ambil minuman.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.55,0:16:24.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa dia?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.38,0:16:26.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sota! Awas!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.66,0:16:31.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kena!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.01,0:16:34.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sota!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.66,0:16:36.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana pendapatmu\Nsoal pakaian renang kami?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.77,0:16:43.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Me-Menurutku, kalian cantik sekali hari ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.90,0:16:46.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bukan reaksi yang kuinginkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.28,0:16:46.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.09,0:16:50.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku cukup percaya diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.66,0:16:52.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial. Mengecewakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.38,0:16:53.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kecewa kenapa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.55,0:16:54.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Oshio!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.28,0:17:01.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu, Kak Mayo yang memilihkan\Npakaian renang ini untukku...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.86,0:17:03.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana... menurutmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.97,0:17:06.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, bagus sekali. Manis.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.80,0:17:10.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Te-Terima kasih...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.72,0:17:14.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus. Anak pintar.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.63,0:17:18.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sota, kau benar-benar tidak mempan,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.33,0:17:19.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,kecuali oleh Koharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.75,0:17:22.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak mengerti apa maksudmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.31,0:17:27.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi apa kau bisa tetap tenang\Nsaat Sato kesayanganmu muncul?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.81,0:17:29.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.46,0:17:33.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, sepertinya dia sudah menunggu\Ndengan deg-degan!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.73,0:17:37.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang, saatnya Sato\Ndengan pakaian renangnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.11,0:17:42.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.07,0:17:43.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada siapa-siapa di sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.74,0:17:44.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.19,0:17:44.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.72,0:17:45.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.58,0:17:50.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.98,0:17:51.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.71,0:17:54.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa artinya itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.74,0:17:55.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Oshio!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.79,0:17:58.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di balik bebatuan itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.36,0:18:00.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah? Apa itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.42,0:18:01.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,teritip...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.62,0:18:03.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,raksasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.95,0:18:05.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, jangan-jangan itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.85,0:18:10.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.17,0:18:12.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, syukurlah, kau tidak hilang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.10,0:18:14.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bisa ditumbuhi lumut\Nkalau terus diam di tempat teduh begini!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.97,0:18:16.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, waktunya berenang!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.11,0:18:19.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak bisa!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.35,0:18:21.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah! Kau mengagetkanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.06,0:18:24.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku malu sekali. Rasanya mau mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.24,0:18:26.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau ini kenapa, sih?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.31,0:18:29.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya langsung ke pantai\Nterlalu berat untuknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.30,0:18:32.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Koharu, kau tidak akan bisa\Nbersenang-senang kalau meringkuk begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.36,0:18:36.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong jangan pedulikan aku.\NBersenang-senanglah tanpa aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.79,0:18:39.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan menjaga barang-barang kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.05,0:18:40.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayolah, Koharu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.46,0:18:43.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah, sudah.\NDia pasti takut dikerubungi kita semua.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.84,0:18:45.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah! Sempurna!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.13,0:18:45.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia kuserahkan padamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.96,0:18:46.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ta-Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.37,0:18:50.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.30,0:18:55.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu, aku akan menemanimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku benar-benar minta maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.55,0:19:02.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal kau sudah repot-repot mengajakku...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.15,0:19:03.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sama sekali tidak repot.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.19,0:19:07.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mengajakmu\Nkarena aku ingin ke sini bersamamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.06,0:19:11.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, kalau kau tidak mau berenang,\Naku akan di sini bersamamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.75,0:19:14.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ti-Tidak boleh begitu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.01,0:19:19.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,K-Kau tidak boleh begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.36,0:19:23.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau harus bersenang-senang.\NTidak usah memikirkanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.33,0:19:29.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini, dari dulu aku suka\Nduduk memandangi laut lama-lama.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.15,0:19:35.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktu aku kecil, Nenek Kanami\Nsering mengajakku jalan-jalan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.96,0:19:38.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami berjalan menyusuri pantai,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.36,0:19:40.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia membelikanku es krim\Ndi tempat peristirahatan,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.39,0:19:43.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu kami memandangi\Npemandangan seperti ini seharian.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.47,0:19:47.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku suka sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu sebabnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.72,0:19:54.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku senang sekali bisa melihat\Npemandangan kesukaanku bersamamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.99,0:19:56.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.79,0:20:00.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.67,0:20:04.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak harus berenang.\NKau juga tidak harus pakai pakaian renang.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.93,0:20:07.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada banyak cara lain untuk menikmati pantai.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.18,0:20:07.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benarkah?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.63,0:20:09.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.15,0:20:19.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya, buat lingkaran\Ndan pasang pose peace.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.99,0:20:22.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Peace?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.65,0:20:24.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato, kau juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seperti ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.76,0:20:29.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Manisnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.42,0:20:31.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang, arahkan ke bawah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.44,0:20:33.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, aku paham sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.44,0:20:35.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu yang kau inginkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.23,0:20:39.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata idemu kekanak-kanakan juga,\NKak Oshio.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, kau juga, Sato.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.92,0:20:43.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, keluarkan ponselmu...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.40,0:20:45.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.62,0:20:47.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cheese!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.52,0:20:48.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.39,0:20:51.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku ingin Sato yang memotret...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.89,0:20:53.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia juga bisa memotretnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.42,0:20:55.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini, Koharu!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.30,0:20:58.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Inilah yang ingin Sota tunjukkan padamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.08,0:21:07.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bintang...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.14,0:21:09.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memang bukan ide baru,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.90,0:21:11.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi kita bisa melakukan\Nbanyak hal bersama-sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.39,0:21:14.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.02,0:21:20.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Te-Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.05,0:21:27.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku senang sekali bisa ke pantai bersamamu...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.81,0:21:36.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.19,0:21:45.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sa-Sato, anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.94,0:21:49.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau cantik sekali dengan pakaian renangmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.43,0:23:37.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya, "Kunci Kekasih".
Dialogue: 10,0:23:37.90,0:23:40.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita lakukan bersama.
